1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,256
You're chopping an onion

2
00:00:01,256 --> 00:00:03,050
like a TV chef...

3
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,164
chop, chop, chop...

4
00:00:04,164 --> 00:00:05,300
and suddenly you're

5
00:00:05,308 --> 00:00:06,890
SOBBING.

6
00:00:07,012 --> 00:00:08,360
It's an onion.

7
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,633
Nobody died.

8
00:00:09,679 --> 00:00:10,730
Here's the thing.

9
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:11,815
Every onion cell

10
00:00:11,815 --> 00:00:13,900
is a tiny booby trap.

11
00:00:13,935 --> 00:00:15,080
Two chemicals,

12
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,730
kept in separate rooms...

13
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:17,710
until your knife

14
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:19,233
smashes the wall.

15
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:20,174
They mix,

16
00:00:20,174 --> 00:00:21,029
an enzyme makes

17
00:00:21,029 --> 00:00:22,509
a sulfur compound...

18
00:00:22,509 --> 00:00:24,098
then a SECOND enzyme

19
00:00:24,098 --> 00:00:25,529
turns it into...

20
00:00:25,529 --> 00:00:26,800
tear gas.

21
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:27,920
Its real name?

22
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,827
Propanethial S-oxide.

23
00:00:31,066 --> 00:00:31,767
Bless you.

24
00:00:31,816 --> 00:00:33,000
It floats up,

25
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,189
lands on your eyes,

26
00:00:34,189 --> 00:00:36,067
and pings the nerves there.

27
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:37,000
Your brain yells

28
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:37,944
DANGER...

29
00:00:37,944 --> 00:00:38,881
and floods your eyes

30
00:00:38,881 --> 00:00:40,233
to wash it out.

31
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:42,033
So you're not crying.

32
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,280
You're...

33
00:00:43,373 --> 00:00:44,333
rinsing.

34
00:00:44,373 --> 00:00:46,010
And it gets weirder.

35
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:46,935
High-speed cameras

36
00:00:46,935 --> 00:00:48,790
caught onions spraying

37
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,371
tiny droplets...

38
00:00:50,371 --> 00:00:51,891
up to sixty centimeters

39
00:00:51,891 --> 00:00:52,667
high!

40
00:00:52,691 --> 00:00:53,828
A blunt knife,

41
00:00:53,828 --> 00:00:54,990
or chopping fast

42
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,470
like a TV chef...

43
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:58,224
sprays way

44
00:00:58,224 --> 00:00:59,000
MORE.

45
00:00:59,029 --> 00:01:01,029
So: sharp knife,

46
00:01:01,029 --> 00:01:02,620
